%%{init: {'theme': 'base', 'themeVariables': {'fontSize': '13px'}}}%%
graph TB
  PA["Peer A<br/>(at Site 1)"]
  PB["Peer B<br/>(at Site 2)"]

  subgraph S1["Site 1 mgmt-host"]
    SS_1[signal-server-1<br/>per-peer registry]
  end

  subgraph S2["Site 2 mgmt-host"]
    SS_2[signal-server-2<br/>per-peer registry]
  end

  subgraph S3["Site 3 mgmt-host"]
    SS_3[signal-server-3<br/>per-peer registry]
  end

  PA -- register/exchange --> SS_1
  PB -- register/exchange --> SS_2

  SS_1 <==>|Forward RPC<br/>correlation IDs| SS_2
  SS_2 <==>|Forward RPC| SS_3
  SS_1 <==>|Forward RPC| SS_3

  PA -. WG P2P after exchange .-> PB

  NOTE["Site numbering is notional — concrete site identifiers<br/>are defined in operational inventory."]

  style S1 fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2
  style S2 fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#f57c00
  style S3 fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#388e3c
  style NOTE fill:#fafafa,stroke:#9e9e9e,stroke-dasharray: 3 3
